{"block_index": 1, "block_type": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "heading_path": ["PRISMA 2020"], "text": "PRISMA 2020 consists of a statement paper , which includes a description of how the reporting guideline was developed and presents a checklist of items and sub-items, an expanded checklist that details reporting recommendations for each item/sub-item, an abstract checklist , and template flow diagrams for original and updated reviews. Users are advised to read the PRISMA 2020 statement paper in conjunction with the explanation and elaboration paper , which provides exemplars of good reporting and explanations to enhance the use, understanding and dissemination of PRISMA 2020.", "locator": "dom:p:1", "document_id": "DOC-608a6dd2fc33487b", "source_id": "SRC-PRISMA-2020"}
{"block_index": 2, "block_type": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "heading_path": ["PRISMA 2020"], "text": "To find out more about the PRISMA 2020 statement and explanation and elaboration paper, obtain downloads of the PRISMA 2020 checklists and flow diagrams, and learn about the history, development and funding of PRISMA 2020, click on the links below:", "locator": "dom:p:2", "document_id": "DOC-608a6dd2fc33487b", "source_id": "SRC-PRISMA-2020"}
